    'faq.g2.q': 'Is SKINSELL legit?',
    'faq.g2.a': 'Yes. We use Steam\'s official OpenID authentication \u2014 we never ask for your password. All trades go through Steam\'s trading system. Your order status is tracked in real time and all operations are logged.',
