    'faq.s1.q': 'How can I secure my account?',
    'faq.s1.a': 'Enable Steam Guard Mobile Authenticator. Never share your Trade URL publicly and regenerate it if compromised. We will never ask for your Steam password or login credentials.',
    'faq.s2.q': 'How do I avoid scams when selling skins?',
    'faq.s2.a': 'Always verify trade offers come from our official bots. Never click suspicious links or share your API key. SKINSELL will never ask you to send items without a proper trade offer through Steam.',

