    'faq.t1.a': 'A Trade URL is a unique link that allows us to send you a Steam trade offer. You need to provide it before selling. Find yours at: Steam \u2192 Settings \u2192 Privacy \u2192 Trade Offers \u2192 Copy your Trade URL.',
    'faq.t2.q': 'Why are items missing from my inventory?',
